  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3603.02 Hours of Hotline Operation. The hotline shall be answered by the division of state police 24 hours a day.\n\nSource. #5382, eff 4-21-92; ss by #6703, eff 3-3-98; ss by #8553, eff 1-26-06; ss by #10591, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14008, eff 6-25-24",
